    <rdfs:label>Activity: activityhalted activitynotcompleted states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the activityhalted activitynotcompleted path of the Activity workflow, in order: ActivityHalted, ActivityNotCompleted. A transition is legal between adjacent states. An activity's lifecycle in the Data Privacy Vocabulary: proposed, planned, ongoing, halted, completed, not completed.</rdfs:comment>
